        "abstract": "Full extraction of randomized phase III DESTINY-Breast03 trial (NCT03529110) comparing Trastuzumab Deruxtecan (T-DXd) against Trastuzumab Emtansine (T-DM1) in HER2-positive metastatic breast cancer previously treated with trastuzumab and a taxane (Round 1491833). 12-month progression-free survival (PFS) was 75.8% (95% CI, 69.8 to 80.7) for T-DXd vs 34.1% (95% CI, 27.7 to 40.5) for T-DM1 (stratified hazard ratio for disease progression or death, 0.28; 95% CI, 0.22 to 0.37; P<0.001). Key secondary endpoint overall survival (OS) demonstrated 12-month OS of 94.1% vs 85.9% (HR 0.55; 95% CI, 0.36 to 0.86). Drug-related interstitial lung disease occurred in 10.5% (all Grade 1/2) with zero Grade 4/5 events. Mathematical variance verified down to SE(ln HR)=0.1337.",
        "submittedAt": "2026-09-24T15:45:28.639Z"
