        "abstract": "Translational evidence synthesis on multicenter cohort investigating optimal ADC ordering (Sacituzumab Govitecan vs Trastuzumab Deruxtecan) in HER2-low metastatic breast cancer following endocrine resistance (Round 1491832). Patients receiving T-DXd followed by SG demonstrated median PFS1 of 7.2 months and PFS2 of 4.1 months, compared to median PFS1 of 4.8 months and PFS2 of 3.2 months for the reverse sequence. Payload cross-resistance was observed between topoisomerase-I inhibitors (SN-38 and deruxtecan/DXd), highlighting a critical translational requirement for distinct non-overlapping cytotoxic payloads in sequential ADC treatment paradigms.",
